---
model: googleai/gemini-flash-latest
config:
  thinkingConfig:
    thinkingLevel: MEDIUM
input:
  schema: JokeRequest
output:
  format: json
  # Written out inline rather than referencing a registered schema by name, as
  # the input above and recipe.prompt both do. Handy for a shape only one
  # prompt uses; the fields still have to line up with the Go type the caller
  # unmarshals into.
  schema:
    joke: string, The joke text
    category: string, The joke category
---
Share a long joke about {{topic}}.

